{"version":"2026.10.11-r25","id":"Q15410178","formula":"C₃₀H₄₈O₃","hill":"C30H48O3","elements":["H","C","O"],"composition":{"C":30.0,"H":48.0,"O":3.0},"names":{"en":"Testosterone undecanoate","ru":"Андриол"},"descriptions":{"en":"Testosterone undecanoate, sold under the brand name Nebido among others, is an androgen and anabolic steroid (AAS) medication that is used mainly in the treatment of low testosterone levels in men, It is taken by mouth or given by injection into muscle. Side effects of testosterone undecanoate include symptoms of masculinization like acne, increased hair growth, voice changes, hypertension, elevated liver enzymes, hypertriglyceridemia, and increased sexual desire. The drug is a prodrug of testosterone, the biological ligand of the androgen receptor (AR) and hence is an androgen and anabolic steroid.","ru":"Андриол (Andriol) — лекарственное средство, препарат тестостерона (эфир тестостерона и ундекановой кислоты). Он продаётся под торговыми марками Aveed, Andriol, Undestor, Nebido, Pantestone, Restandol, Cernos Depot, Nebido-R и Reandron 1000."},"fame":11,"pubchemCid":65157,"mass":456.7,"charge":0,"smiles":"CCCCCCCCCCC(=O)O[C@H]1CC[C@@H]2[C@@]1(CC[C@H]3[C@H]2CCC4=CC(=O)CC[C@]34C)C","inchikey":"UDSFVOAUHKGBEK-CNQKSJKFSA-N","iupac":"[(8R,9S,10R,13S,14S,17S)-10,13-dimethyl-3-oxo-1,2,6,7,8,9,11,12,14,15,16,17-dodecahydrocyclopenta[a]phenanthren-17-yl] undecanoate","classes":[{"qid":"Q113145171","names":{"en":"type of chemical entity","ru":"тип химического объекта","uk":"тип хімічної сутності"}}],"structureInfo":{"kind":"molecule","source":"pubchem","ref":"65157","atoms":81,"license":"PubChem (NIH), public data"},"structure":{"kind":"molecule","atoms":[{"x":-0.904,"y":3.971,"z":0.049,"el":"O"},{"x":6.231,"y":-4.072,"z":-1.379,"el":"O"},{"x":-1.065,"y":3.693,"z":-2.238,"el":"O"},{"x":2.175,"y":2.095,"z":0.589,"el":"C"},{"x":0.671,"y":2.085,"z":0.252,"el":"C"},{"x":2.708,"y":0.705,"z":0.95,"el":"C"},{"x":2.484,"y":-0.251,"z":-0.265,"el":"C"},{"x":3